<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Investmentbank Austria.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.25     MATURITY    28.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.79    PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	WOODCOMMERZ IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
